# ESRF Example 5 iron -- Cubit mesh + Netgen .vol export.
#
# The caller defines the APREPRO variable "msize" (element size, metres)
# before playing this file; the CAD itself lives in example5_iron.jou.
#
# NOTE: Cubit's APREPRO evaluates brace expressions even inside "#" comment
# lines, so never write a brace expression in a comment here.
imprint volume all
merge volume all
block 1 add volume all
block 1 name "iron"
volume all scheme auto
volume all size {msize}
mesh volume all
